    "detailed_description": "WORDKOUR - Are You a Parkour Enthusiast Who also likes Word Games ?<br />\r\nThen WORDKOUR is for You !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSolve Word Puzzles while leaping Your way around many, many fun and exciting levels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect the Correct Letters to Spell out the Word of the Level, While using Your Parkour Skills to hop all over the Map.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach Level gets more Challenging in this Family Friendly Action Game !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Game features procedurally generated Maps utilizing advanced Artificial intelligence for Optimization.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are also Puzzle Elements Like Keys and Switches to Solve.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can also collect Power-Ups Like Health, Super Jump, Flying, and More.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are also some Mystery Word Levels to add to the Fun !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow Jump to it !",
